{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y压缩后少数心理转折的先后关系和细微情绪有所变薄，尤其S08暖意消退的具体缘由、S11从仍抱希望到暂缓决定的心理过程，X表达得更细。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的大字更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住每段的核心变化，不必读完整段落才能理解发生了什么；小字又补上了不少重要的心理连接，例如不是想通了而是累了、承认曾经快乐不等于否定离开。各段之间的情绪脉络也更容易串起来，尤其从怀念、动摇、重新认识自己的需要，到最后不再把陪伴当作生活的前提，形成了清楚的整体走向。不过X在部分段落保留了更丰富的心理层次和时间变化，Y有些地方为了凝练而损失了这种细腻感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd55766d-44a8-416d-b088-acd99e689921", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193855356642Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:40:03.550353+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "49f3651433d589a0dfc1363ea8ff63de47d4b72678041037a1d5f430e6382a85", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 